# DESK24 "after", answer 1: the folder name conflict, answered with OK on an
# UNCHANGED name -> EmuTOS merges into the existing folder (output_path's
# `ret == 1` break, deskdir.c:770-775).
#
# C:\DESKT24\FOLD is dragged onto the C: desktop icon, i.e. a folder copy into
# C:\, where C:\FOLD already exists (seed.sh).
#   C:\ window DESKT24 (431,103)          probe run 1
#   DESKT24 window FOLD (119,127)         probe run 2
#   desktop C: icon (38,35)               probe run 1
#   ADCPYDEL OK (229,301)   ADCPALER OK (224,301)   (the [d24] dumps)
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 key 38
1550 key 2e
1600 key ae
1650 key b8
2800 mark B_ALTC
3100 move 431 103
3400 down
3403 up
3410 down
3413 up
4100 parkbr
4900 mark C_SUBDIR
5300 move 119 127
5900 down
6700 drag 100 100
7300 drag 60 60
7900 drag 38 35
8700 up
9300 parkbr
10100 mark D_COPYBOX
10500 move 229 301
11100 down
11300 up
11900 parkbr
12700 mark E_CONFLICT
13100 move 224 301
